# basePath DesignSplitter
// Splitter

::Intro
@trigger    OnDesignSetupComplete
$set temp:hintGiven = 0
{@PAL} Use one signal to decide where to send the other.

::Hints
@trigger    OnSingleTestComplete
@when       result == "failure"
$if temp:hintGiven == 0
    {@PAL}  Hint: Check the Verification Table.\nWhen B is LO, X receives a signal.\nWhen B is HI, Y receives a signal.
    $set temp:hintGiven == 1
$elseif temp:hintGiven == 1
    {@PAL}  Hint: X and Y always receive signals from A.
    $set temp:hintGiven == 0
$endif